      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hartford%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "White River Junction became a center of transportation and industry after the railroads arrived in Hartford in 1848.",
